    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="62">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 62</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hamsocne. Gyf hwa hamsocne gewyrce, gebete ðæt mid V pundum ðam kynincge on Engla lage, [⁊ on Dena] lage swa hit ær stod.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Attacks upon men's houses. If a man makes forcible entry into another man's house, he shall pay £5 to the king as compensation for so doing in districts under English law, and in the Danelaw the amount fixed by existing regulations.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa hamsocne gewyrce, gebete þæt mid V pundan þam cingce on Engla lage (⁊ on Cent æt hamsocne V þam cingce ⁊ þreo þam arcebisceope), ⁊ Dena lage, swa hit ær stod.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
